{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15020","headline":"送内弟韦宗仁归信州觐省 · 卢纶","name":"送内弟韦宗仁归信州觐省","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常嗟外族兄弟稀，转觉心孤是送归。\n醉掩壶觞人有泪，梦惊波浪日无辉。\n烹鱼绿岸烟浮草，摘橘青溪露湿衣。\n闻说江楼长卷幔，几回风起望胡威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}